# true-first-run component seal sidecar.
#
# Per the SEAL_COMMIT sidecar pattern (workspace-bootstrap/tests/
# test_no_sealed_amendments.py header): the actual commit SHA is
# written here by the sealing ritual after the component build lands
# and the owner confirms the seal commit. During build, this sidecar
# holds the placeholder "HEAD" so the build's own verification passes
# against the current tip without hardcoding a sha into the test
# layer.
#
# Once sealed, overwrite with the exact commit SHA (8+ chars). No
# behavioural amendment to the true-first-run component ships without
# a new amendment cycle that updates BASELINE and bumps this SEAL_COMMIT.
#
# Amendment cycle — Claude Code hook schema regression (2026-04-22):
# the ship-time + post-self-retire SessionStart stanzas used the
# obsolete flat-object shape (`{type: command, command: ...}` directly
# in the SessionStart array). Current Claude Code schema rejects this
# at session start. The amendment migrates both shapes — plus the
# stanza-builder helpers and the settings-merge walkers — to the
# current `{matcher, hooks: [...]}` envelope. No behavioural change
# beyond the schema fix. SEAL_COMMIT is re-pinned at the amendment
# commit; BASELINE in hands-off-lifecycle/tests/test_cross_cutting.py
# is advanced to 7711249 (the pre-amendment tip) so diff-scope reflects
# this amendment only.
#
# Amendment cycle — editable-install phase (2026-04-22, second
# amendment): fresh clones could not complete first-run because
# per-component Python packages were never placed on sys.path.
# Phase 2 installed shared runtime deps from each component's
# requirements.txt, but no phase ever ran `pip install -e` on the
# components themselves. On fresh clone, Phase 4's scaffold raised
# ImportError importing pos_orchestrator / workspace_bootstrap,
# surfacing as -32099 scaffold-failed to the user. The amendment adds
# a Phase 3e editable-install step: discover components via a
# pyproject.toml walk (tomllib, stdlib), topological order by declared
# [project].dependencies, `pip install --no-deps -e <dir>` per
# component, idempotent re-run via PEP 610 direct_url.json inspection.
# No new runtime deps. SEAL_COMMIT is re-pinned at 1b28736; BASELINE
# in hands-off-lifecycle/tests/test_cross_cutting.py is advanced to
# b63c758 (the pre-amendment tip) so diff-scope reflects this
# amendment only.
1b28736
